{"availability":"available","full":"nirholas/three.ws","name":"three.ws","description":"Open-source platform for 3D AI agents. Turn text or a photo into a rigged, animated GLB avatar, give it an LLM brain, memory and a wallet, and embed it anywhere with one web component. Remote MCP server, x402 payments, Three.js, browser-native.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":226,"forks":62,"created":"2026-01-08T20:46:03Z","updated":"2026-10-05T18:14:44Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://three.ws","topics":["3d-generation","ai-agents","animation","avatar","digital-human","generative-ai","glb","gltf","image-to-3d","llm","mcp","mcp-server","model-context-protocol","solana","text-to-3d","threejs","web-components","webgl","webxr","x402"],"demo":"https://three.ws/ibm/x402-demo","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T16:29:41.921Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T16:29:41.921Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T16:29:41.921Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:17:32.137Z","stars":220,"forks":58},{"at":"2026-10-06T16:29:41.921Z","stars":226,"forks":62}],"technologies":["Three.js","Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Website · Docs · Changelog · X / Twitter · GitHub · $THREE on pump.fun","Give your AI a body. three.ws is an open source (Apache-2.0), browser-native 3D AI agent platform. Type a prompt and Forge generates a textured 3D model, or drop a GLB you already have. Add an LLM brain, register on-chain, and embed anywhere: no plugins, no server uploads, no installs required.","Try it in 60 seconds: open three.ws/forge, type \"a brass steampunk owl, full body\", and download the GLB. Text→3D, image→3D, and sketch→3D — free draft tier, no account. Jump to the Forge section ↓"],"features":["Generate: turns a text prompt, up to 6 photos, or a sketch into a textured, downloadable GLB via Forge. Free draft tier, no account required; auto-rigging, restyling, and retexturing in the same flow.","Render — loads and validates glTF 2.0 / GLB models in WebGL 2.0 with zero server-side processing. Drag a file onto the browser and it renders instantly with full Draco, KTX2, and Meshopt decompression.","Embody — wraps any avatar with an LLM brain. The agent listens to the user, thinks with Claude, executes tools (animations, gestures, memory operations, skill calls), and expresses emotion through morph-target blending…","Register — optionally mints the agent on-chain: as an ERC-8004 token on any EVM chain, or as a Metaplex Core NFT on Solana. Either path gives the agent a stable on-chain identity, a wallet address, signed action…","Embed — distributes the agent as an web component that anyone can drop into a page, or as one of five purpose-built widget types (turntable, animation gallery, talking agent, passport card, hotspot tour) with Open Graph…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nirholas/three.ws/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d206ab37a5d4fbe50a4888e182274029460bffaf742ef1de296b88a15589b7ca","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T02:55:52.861Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T02:55:52.861Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Website · Docs · Changelog · X / Twitter · GitHub · $THREE on pump.fun","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nirholas/three.ws/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"Text→3D, image→3D, and sketch→3D — free draft tier, no account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nirholas/three.ws/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"Free draft tier, no account required; auto-rigging, restyling, and retexturing in the same flow.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nirholas/three.ws/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"The entire stack (viewer, agent runtime, contracts, backend, and web component) is open source in this repository under the Apache License 2.0: fork it, self-host it, and ship commercial work on it.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nirholas/three.ws/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Multiple generation engines with live health checks: self-hosted lanes plus bring-your-own-key Meshy and Tripo (keys stay in the browser)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nirholas/three.ws/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"SIWX (Sign-In with X-chain) server for auth-gated paid endpoints","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nirholas/three.ws/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"Drag-to-rotate, scroll-to-zoom, full PBR rendering — no API key, no account required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nirholas/three.ws/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"d206ab37a5d4fbe50a4888e182274029460bffaf742ef1de296b88a15589b7ca","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nirholas/three.ws/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T02:55:52.866Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T18:14:44Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nirholas/three.ws/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T02:55:52.887Z","hash":"d206ab37a5d4fbe50a4888e182274029460bffaf742ef1de296b88a15589b7ca","originalBytes":412041,"storedBytes":412041,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["vertex","loop","endfacet","endloop","facet","normal","outer","api","agent","tests","src","avatar","docs","run","solana","live","public","x402","three.ws","token","every","npm","post","mcp","agents","three-ws","server","voice","model","user","embed","widget","get","any","chat","key","runtime","via","wallet","cron","memory","pump.fun","studio","skill","tools","claude","full","one","reputation","skills","build","on-chain","paid","specs","glb","text","manifest","mint","erc-8004","url","viewer","what","avatars","coin","core","same","see","session","contracts","ibm","open","cloud","code","identity","app","own","asset","each","name","sdk","without","brain","demos","platform","tool","usdc","client","evm","status","widgets","action","description","